{"id":"n25451-3-9","stage":2,"title":"초점 · 焦点","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25451-3-9-1","ko":"요즘 칠판이 흐리게 보이고 초점이 잘 안 맞아.","zh":"最近看黑板模糊，对不上焦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"칠판이","meaning":"黑板","explanation":"칠판：黑板；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"칠판","audio":"/audio/8159b3904bd24a7d1a09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18796","senseId":"1","lemma":"칠판","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"칠판이","audio":"/audio/cb1261dd79146e445a0d.mp3"}},{"text":"흐리게","meaning":"模糊、不清晰（看东西）","explanation":"흐리다 第三义是不清楚、不鲜明；흐리게 보이다 指看起来模糊，本句不是液体浑浊。","readings":[{"term":"흐리다","audio":"/audio/d48eac7caf4431460a48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89184","senseId":"3","lemma":"흐리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흐리게","audio":"/audio/62d308c7c0afeae1a502.mp3"}},{"text":"보이고","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이고","audio":"/audio/683be65ef5399a6b3144.mp3"}},{"text":"초점이","meaning":"焦点","explanation":"초점：焦点；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"초점","audio":"/audio/cb9083827256abe381ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25451","senseId":"3","lemma":"초점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초점이","audio":"/audio/d5025db43267734d2639.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘"